<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.6000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.6000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.6000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.8500 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     July 8		  July 7</p>
<p> High			     75.6701		 75.8800</p>
<p> Low				75.6000		 75.7552</p>
<p> Open			     75.6000		 75.8800</p>
<p> Close			    75.6000		 75.8500</p>
<p> Volume ($ mln)		  6.915		   5.355</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
